+    // Selah patch (patches/expo-pip+2.1.0.patch):
+    // Android pauses the app while it is in the small window, and React Native stops drawing
+    // while the app is paused. Keep it drawing in the small window, so the app can show only
+    // the video there. When the small window is closed, send "onPipClosed" (the app pauses the
+    // video) and let React Native rest again.
